{
  "category": "Vine Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "The whole body is swathed with wide vines that are similar to seaweed. Its vines shake as it walks.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "The whole body is swathed with wide vines that are similar to seaweed. Its vines shake as it walks.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its identity is obscured by masses of thick, blue vines. The vines are said to never stop growing.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "The vines that cloak its entire body are always jiggling. They effectively unnerve its foes.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It tangles any moving thing with its vines. Their subtle shaking is ticklish if you get ensnared.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "During battle, it constantly moves the vines that cover its body in order to annoy its opponent.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "TANGELA’s vines snap off easily if they are grabbed. This happens without pain, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by newly grown vines the very next day.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "TANGELA’s vines snap off easily if they are grabbed. This happens without pain, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by newly grown vines the very next day.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its vines snap off easily and painlessly if they are grabbed, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by new growth the very next day.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blue plant vines cloak the POKéMON’s identity in a tangled mass. It entangles anything that gets close.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "The whole body is swathed with wide vines that are similar to seaweed. The vines sway as it walks.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is shrouded by blue vines. No one has seen the face hidden behind this growth of vines.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is shrouded by blue vines. No one has seen the face hidden behind this growth of vines.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "The blue vines shrouding its body are covered in a growth of fine hair. It is known to be ticklish.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "The vines that cloak its entire body are always jiggling. They effectively unnerve its foes.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It tangles any moving thing with its vines. Their subtle shaking is ticklish if you get ensnared.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "The blue vines shrouding its body are covered in a growth of fine hair. It is known to be ticklish.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "The blue vines shrouding its body are covered in a growth of fine hair. It is known to be ticklish.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "It tangles any moving thing with its vines. Their subtle shaking is ticklish if you get ensnared.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tangela’s vines snap off easily if they are grabbed. This happens without pain, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by newly grown vines the very next day.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tangela’s vines snap off easily if they are grabbed. This happens without pain, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by newly grown vines the very next day.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its identity is obscured by masses of thick blue vines. The vines are said to never stop growing.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its identity is obscured by masses of thick blue vines. The vines are said to never stop growing.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hidden beneath a tangle of vines that grows nonstop even if the vines are torn off, this Pokémon’s true appearance remains a mystery.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "The vines of a Tangela have a distinct scent. In some parts of Galar, Tangela vines are used as herbs.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is cloaked entirely in blue vines, preventing any glimpse of its true identity. The vines impart a refreshing sensation when chewed—they're useful as a spice.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
